Description: Modern, modular system information tool for Linux
 nexfetch is a cross-platform system information tool similar to
 neofetch and fastfetch, written in pure C with minimal dependencies.
 .
 Features:
  * Cross-platform — Linux, macOS, and Windows
  * Modular architecture — 21 built-in modules
  * Multiple themes — boxed, classic, and modern
  * Smart logo handling — ASCII and image logos via chafa
  * Auto-scaling — disables logo on narrow terminals
  * Configurable — JSON config + CLI flags
  * Plugin system — load custom .so/.dll modules at runtime

